  "description": "Vehicle interior carpet will be fully protected by OEDRO floor mats from rain, fog, snow, fluids, debris, and other mess. This liner offers your car/SUV with a tidy look while enhancing its resale value.\nFeatures\nPerfect fit. With advanced 3D laser scanning technology, the OEDRO front and rear floor mats are compatible with the 2008-2021 Nissan Frontier Crew Cab.\nAll-weather protection. OEDRO floor mats are made of TPE material, which can fully protect the vehicle's interior carpet from rain, fog, snow, liquid, debris, and other dirt.\nDurable material. TPE material is tough, durable, and easy to clean. Compared with traditional PVC, it has better abrasion resistance, heat resistance, and flexibility in hot/cold weather.\nNo sliding. Nissan floor mats use snap styles, snap-in clips can prevent the car liner set from moving or blocking the pedals.\n2 years warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2008-2021 Nissan Frontier Crew Cab (For without Rockford Fosgate audio system models).",
